hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"164","Allahumma ighfir lahu, Allahumma thabbit-hu. O Allah, forgive him; O Allah, make him firm."
"165","As-salāmu ʿalaykum ahla d-diyāri mina l-muʾminīna wa l-muslimīn, wa innā in shāʾa Llāhu bikum lāḥiqūn, nasʾalu Llāha lanā wa lakum l-ʿāfiyah.. Peace be upon you, O people of the abodes, among the believers and Muslims. And indeed, if Allah wills, we shall join you. We ask Allah to grant us and you well-being."
